class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">The driving-license exam app is live on Cafe Bazaar</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">My driving-license exam app is now live on Cafe Bazaar. What shipped is a version whose core fully works — one honest choice included: Cafe Bazaar only for now because that is where the real users are.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/linkedin-dependency-security-pass-16-15\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-10-13\">Oct 13, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">LinkedIn</span><span>#<!-- -->LinkedIn</span><span>#<!-- -->security</span><span>#<!-- -->build-in-public</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Dependency security pass: 16 alerts and closing 15 of them</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">16 security alerts were sitting on my website repository. 15 are closed as of today with the smallest possible version changes — and the one without an upstream fix is documented and watched, not hidden.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\" aria-label=\"2026-09-29\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">Sep 29, 2026</h2><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">1</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/calm-company-basecamp\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-29\">Sep 29, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Startups</span><span>#<!-- -->startups</span><span>#<!-- -->bootstrapping</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Basecamp keeps proving calm companies outlast blitzscaled ones</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">While most software companies race headcount and burn, Basecamp has run the same playbook for two decades: a handful of products, profitable every year, no growth theater. Why the calm model is newly relevant for founders in 2026.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\" aria-label=\"2026-09-28\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">Sep 28, 2026</h2><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">1</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/linear-method\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-28\">Sep 28, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Startups</span><span>#<!-- -->startups</span><span>#<!-- -->product strategy</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">The Linear method: why saying no to half the roadmap builds the better startup</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Linear grew a devoted user base by refusing the startup default of shipping everything: a slower cadence of opinionated releases and an interface that stays fast. What a small team can copy from that discipline without copying the product.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\" aria-label=\"2026-09-27\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">Sep 27, 2026</h2><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/superhuman-go\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-27\">Sep 27, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">AI</span><span>#<!-- -->AI assistants</span><span>#<!-- -->productivity</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Superhuman Go puts the AI assistant where the work actually happens</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Superhuman Go skips the empty chat box and embeds assistance across the tools you already use — drafting replies and summarizing threads and prepping your next meeting in place. A quiet bet that the future of AI help is contextual and not another tab.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/gpt-6-sol-luna\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-27\">Sep 27, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">AI</span><span>#<!-- -->AI</span><span>#<!-- -->LLM pricing</span><span>#<!-- -->OpenAI</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">GPT-6 Sol and Luna: frontier AI at half the price changes the math for small teams</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">GPT-6 ships as two tuned variants — Sol for deep reasoning and Luna for speed. The bigger story is the price: frontier capability at roughly half of last year&#x27;s cost puts serious AI inside reach of one-person studios.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\" aria-label=\"2026-09-26\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">Sep 26, 2026</h2><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/fewer\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-26\">Sep 26, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Products</span><span>#<!-- -->digital wellbeing</span><span>#<!-- -->launchers</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Fewer is a launcher that counts how often you pick up your phone</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Fewer replaces your home screen with a plain launcher and quietly shows the number most phones hide: how many times a day you pick the device up. Measurement as a design choice — and a rare anti-addiction stance in launch software.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/cuey\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-26\">Sep 26, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">AI</span><span>#<!-- -->AI tools</span><span>#<!-- -->model comparison</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Cuey compares ChatGPT and Claude and Gemini in a single tab</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Cuey sends one prompt to the leading AI models and lines the answers up side by side. It turns the hunch every power user already has — that models are good at different things — into a visible and decision-ready habit.</p><span class=\"mt-auto inline-flex items-center gap-1 pt-3 text-sm font-medium text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Read the analysis<svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-arrow-right h-4 w-4\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><path d=\"M5 12h14\"></path><path d=\"m12 5 7 7-7 7\"></path></svg></span></a></div></section><section class=\"mt-10\" aria-label=\"2026-09-25\"><div class=\"mb-4 flex items-center gap-3\"><h2 class=\"text-lg font-bold tracking-tight\">Sep 25, 2026</h2><span class=\"h-px flex-1 bg-border\" aria-hidden=\"true\"></span><span class=\"text-xs text-muted-foreground\">2</span></div><div class=\"grid gap-4 lg:grid-cols-2\"><a class=\"group flex flex-col rounded-2xl border border-border bg-card p-5 transition-all hover:-translate-y-0.5 hover:border-violet-500/40 hover:shadow-lg hover:shadow-violet-600/5\" href=\"/daily/paragraph-notes\"><div class=\"flex flex-wrap items-center gap-x-3 gap-y-1 text-xs text-muted-foreground\"><time dateTime=\"2026-09-25\">Sep 25, 2026</time><span class=\"text-violet-600 dark:text-violet-400\">Products</span><span>#<!-- -->local-first</span><span>#<!-- -->notes</span></div><h3 class=\"mt-2 text-lg font-bold leading-snug transition-colors group-hover:text-violet-600 dark:group-hover:text-violet-400\">Paragraph Notes is a private Markdown home for your Mac</h3><p class=\"mt-2 line-clamp-3 text-sm leading-relaxed text-muted-foreground\">Paragraph Notes keeps your notes as plain Markdown files on your own disk — no account and no lock-in and no telemetry drama. Part of a wider local-first swing that treats owning your